# Never let secrets or recordings into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/server/eval-clips/*
!apps/server/eval-clips/README.md
!apps/server/eval-clips/labels.example.json

# Rebuilt inside the image; copying them in is slow and can mix architectures.
**/node_modules
**/dist
apps/server/tmp

# Not part of the server build at all.
apps/mobile
.git
.github
.claude
**/*.md
!README.md
.expo
